@startuml
[*] --> SelectAmount : start transaction

state "SelectAmount" as SelectAmount
state "EnterCustomAmount" as EnterCustomAmount
state "VerifyTransaction" as VerifyTransaction
state "DispenseCash" as DispenseCash
state "ReleaseCard" as ReleaseCard

SelectAmount --> VerifyTransaction : amount selected
SelectAmount --> EnterCustomAmount : custom amount

EnterCustomAmount --> VerifyTransaction : amount entered

VerifyTransaction --> DispenseCash : transaction approved
VerifyTransaction --> SelectAmount : transaction rejected

DispenseCash --> ReleaseCard : dispense completed

ReleaseCard --> [*] : transaction complete
@enduml
